us Bar Items (shortcut-triggered actions). Layer 2: View Handlers (.onKeyPress modifiers, deepest view first). A second hasTextInputFocus check skips Layer 3 if text input was focused. Layer 3: Focus System (focused element delegation, Tab\/Shift+Tab, arrow key fallback). Layer 4: Default Bindings (quit, theme, appearance). Unmatched events are dropped.","identifier":"keyboard-event-dispatch.png"}}}